  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Integrity Initiative (Indonesia Pilot)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This initiative will contribute to increased resilience to disinformation and work towards thefollowing overall outcomes:&#xA7; More robust and consistent data gathering, evidence sharing and understanding of disinformation landscapes across relevant stakeholders.&#xA7; Strengthened interventions that support individual and societal resilience to disinformation.&#xA7; Optimised and co-ordinated responses to disinformation from donors, the media sector, civil society and local populations.The initiative will focus on four workstreams:&#xA7; DATA GATHERING to build intelligence about disinformation environments, actors, narratives and threats.&#xA7; MAPPING AND SHARING evidence about the effectiveness of different disinformation tactics and the effectiveness of interventions to counter disinformation campaigns.&#xA7; PILOTING NEW APPROACHES to tackle disinformation and delivering focussed research initiatives to fill critical EVIDENCE gaps.&#xA7; CAPACITY STRENGHTENING SUPPORT to strengthen programmes designed to tackle and build resilience to disinformation.</narrative>
  </description>
